WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:10.574
Jin wanted to have a party.

2
00:00:10.575 --> 00:00:15.203
"Mom, can I have a slumber party?" she asked her mother one evening.

3
00:00:15.204 --> 00:00:20.804
"A slumber party? You mean invite some friends to sleep over at our house?" Mother said.

4
00:00:20.805 --> 00:00:25.271
"Yes. May I? Please?" Jin pleaded with her mom.

5
00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:30.534
The next day at school, Jin invited three of her friends to her slumber party.

6
00:00:30.535 --> 00:00:32.914
"When is it?" Rachel asked.

7
00:00:32.915 --> 00:00:36.939
"This Saturday. Come around four o'clock," Jin said.

8
00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:39.637
"What should we bring?" Mandy asked.

9
00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:41.900
"Your toothbrush and pajamas."

10
00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:48.302
On the day of the slumber party, Jin was busy cleaning her room when her brother Min opened the door.

11
00:00:48.303 --> 00:00:52.159
"How many girls are coming?" he asked.

12
00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:55.348
"None of your business! Go away!"

13
00:00:55.349 --> 00:00:58.967
Min was a troublemaker, but Jin was not worried.

14
00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:02.733
No one would ruin her party─not even her brother!

15
00:01:02.734 --> 00:01:08.515
At four o'clock, Rachel, Mandy, and Fran arrived at Jin's house.

16
00:01:08.516 --> 00:01:12.718
"We're going to have so much fun!" The girls giggled excitedly.

17
00:01:12.719 --> 00:01:16.188
"What should we do first?" Fran asked.

18
00:01:16.189 --> 00:01:22.082
"Let's make cookies!" Mandy suggested.

19
00:01:22.083 --> 00:01:24.613
The girls made chocolate chip cookies.

20
00:01:24.614 --> 00:01:27.813
When they were ready, Min rushed into the kitchen.

21
00:01:27.814 --> 00:01:33.078
"Cookies! My favorite!" he yelled and grabbed some cookies.

22
00:01:33.079 --> 00:01:37.552
"Get out! Those are our cookies!" Jin shouted.

23
00:01:37.553 --> 00:01:40.963
Min took some more cookies and ran out of the kitchen.

24
00:01:40.964 --> 00:01:45.174
Jin had rented some videos to watch with her friends.

25
00:01:45.175 --> 00:01:49.372
The girls took their cookies to the living room and sat down to watch.

26
00:01:49.373 --> 00:01:52.054
The first movie was really exciting.

27
00:01:52.055 --> 00:01:57.015
"Oh, what's going to happen next?" Mandy said, covering her mouth.

28
00:01:57.016 --> 00:02:02.703
"Shh! This is the most important part . . ." Fran's eyes got big.

29
00:02:02.704 --> 00:02:05.631
Suddenly the channel switched to a soccer game.

30
00:02:05.642 --> 00:02:10.869
"What happened?" the girls cried out. Jin looked around.

31
00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:14.906
There, behind the couch, was Min holding the remote control.

32
00:02:14.907 --> 00:02:17.682
"Min!" Jin shouted loudly.

33
00:02:17.683 --> 00:02:20.910
She went and told her parents everything Min had done.

34
00:02:20.911 --> 00:02:26.719
"Min, you promised not to bother your sister and her friends," Father reminded him sternly.

35
00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:32.178
"Don't even go near Jin's room! Do you understand?" Mother said.

36
00:02:32.179 --> 00:02:37.190
"Stay away from us!" Jin yelled at him.

37
00:02:37.191 --> 00:02:42.108
She took some pizza from the kitchen, and the girls all went up to her room to eat it.

38
00:02:42.109 --> 00:02:46.864
After they ate the pizza, the four friends decided to have some fun.

39
00:02:46.865 --> 00:02:49.985
"Let me do your hair!" Rachel said.

40
00:02:49.986 --> 00:02:54.789
But Mandy had an even better idea. "Look what I brought!"

41
00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:57.544
"Makeup!" screamed the girls.

42
00:02:57.545 --> 00:03:04.770
"It's my sister's. I borrowed it for tonight!" Mandy giggled.

43
00:03:04.771 --> 00:03:09.898
In no time at all, all the girls had fancy hairstyles and glamorous makeup.

44
00:03:09.899 --> 00:03:14.203
"You look great!" Fran admired Rachel's eyes.

45
00:03:14.204 --> 00:03:18.121
"You look like Britney Spears!" Jin said to Mandy.

46
00:03:18.122 --> 00:03:21.644
Suddenly the girls all stopped and looked at each other.

47
00:03:21.645 --> 00:03:24.690
"Let's make a band!" they shouted.

48
00:03:24.691 --> 00:03:30.100
The girls danced and sang their favorite songs.

49
00:03:30.101 --> 00:03:34.604
They were having so much fun that it was past ten o'clock before they knew it.

50
00:03:34.605 --> 00:03:39.688
The friends changed into their pajamas, and Jin's parents came up to say good night.

51
00:03:39.689 --> 00:03:43.243
"Don't stay up too late, girls," Jin's father said.

52
00:03:43.244 --> 00:03:47.686
"If you get hungry, there's some cake in the kitchen," Mother said.

53
00:03:47.687 --> 00:03:52.560
"Thank you. Good night!" the girls called out.

54
00:03:52.561 --> 00:03:57.487
After Jin's parents closed the door to the room, Fran turned to the others.

55
00:03:57.488 --> 00:04:01.674
"Well, good night, girls!" Fran said.

56
00:04:01.675 --> 00:04:04.483
Rachel, Mandy, and Jin stared at her.

57
00:04:04.484 --> 00:04:09.292
"Fran! We're going to stay up all night!" Mandy said.

58
00:04:09.293 --> 00:04:14.359
"But we already did everything," Fran complained.

59
00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:21.531
"We still haven't done the most exciting part of a slumber party." Rachel smiled.

60
00:04:21.532 --> 00:04:25.201
"Ghost stories!" everyone screamed.

61
00:04:25.202 --> 00:04:31.467
Jin went first. She told them a scary story about a woman who was murdered by her husband.

62
00:04:31.468 --> 00:04:36.923
"People say they can still see her ghost searching for her husband."

63
00:04:36.924 --> 00:04:43.488
"Now it's my turn," Rachel said. Rachel's story was even scarier than Jin's.

64
00:04:43.489 --> 00:04:48.152
It was about a strange man who only killed girls.

65
00:04:48.153 --> 00:04:52.980
"The little girl thought she was safe, but she suddenly heard footsteps.

66
00:04:52.981 --> 00:04:56.536
No one ever saw that girl again."

67
00:04:56.537 --> 00:05:00.794
"What . . . what did he look like?" Mandy whispered.

68
00:05:00.795 --> 00:05:05.376
"They say he wore a long cloak and had spiky hair."

69
00:05:05.377 --> 00:05:08.332
Rachel pulled her hair up.

70
00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:12.353
"That was so scary!" Fran shivered.

71
00:05:12.354 --> 00:05:17.419
"Let's take a break and have some cake," Jin suggested.

72
00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.210
They all went down to the kitchen in the dark.

73
00:05:20.211 --> 00:05:23.534
"Don't turn the lights on," Jin whispered.

74
00:05:23.535 --> 00:05:28.181
"Ouch! I can't see anything," complained Mandy.

75
00:05:28.182 --> 00:05:33.162
"Shh! You'll wake everyone up!" Rachel covered Mandy's mouth.

76
00:05:33.163 --> 00:05:38.267
"I got the cake," Jin said quietly after they reached the kitchen.

77
00:05:38.268 --> 00:05:42.799
The girls tiptoed quietly back toward Jin's room.

78
00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:45.422
"What was that?" whispered Rachel.

79
00:05:45.423 --> 00:05:48.041
"It's not me!" Mandy said.

80
00:05:48.042 --> 00:05:50.454
They saw a strange shadow approaching.

81
00:05:50.455 --> 00:05:56.167
"Oh . . . oh . . . l-look!" Fran pointed.

82
00:05:56.168 --> 00:06:01.279
"It's him! He's here!" Rachel's voice quivered.

83
00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:05.852
The girls screamed as loud as they could, and Jin threw the cake in the air.

84
00:06:05.853 --> 00:06:10.499
When they heard the noise, Jin's parents came running.

85
00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:13.961
"What's going on here?" shouted Jin's father.

86
00:06:13.962 --> 00:06:17.671
The four friends were crying and holding onto each other.

87
00:06:17.672 --> 00:06:22.634
"He's here! He's going to kill us!" cried Fran.

88
00:06:22.635 --> 00:06:26.425
"There's nobody here," Jin's mother said.

89
00:06:26.426 --> 00:06:29.616
The girls stopped crying and opened their eyes.

90
00:06:29.617 --> 00:06:35.656
"But we all saw him," Mandy wiped some cream from the cake away from her eyes.

91
00:06:35.657 --> 00:06:38.586
The friends looked puzzled.

92
00:06:38.587 --> 00:06:42.972
Suddenly there was a sound from behind the door. It was Min.

93
00:06:42.973 --> 00:06:46.927
"Is this who you saw?" smiled Jin's mother.

94
00:06:46.928 --> 00:06:49.826
"Min!" screamed the girls.

95
00:06:49.827 --> 00:06:53.654
"This time it wasn't your brother's fault," Father said.

96
00:06:53.655 --> 00:06:55.981
Min had woken up and was thirsty.

97
00:06:55.982 --> 00:06:59.230
He had gone to the kitchen to get a glass of water.

98
00:06:59.231 --> 00:07:04.165
"I hope you learned a lesson," Mother said.

99
00:07:04.166 --> 00:07:07.628
The girls giggled and soon everyone was laughing.

100
00:07:07.629 --> 00:07:12.259
"Thank you for everything," Jin said to her parents the next evening.

101
00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:15.403
"Did everyone have a good time?" asked Mother.

102
00:07:15.404 --> 00:07:21.072
"Oh yes! It was the best slumber party ever!" Jin smiled at everyone.

103
00:07:21.073 --> 00:07:25.707
"Good. Next week we're having another one!" Mother said.

104
00:07:25.708 --> 00:07:32.567
"This time it's Min's turn."
